+# grimaldi.ca — Vincenzo Ceccarelli Grimaldi (personal site)
+
+> grimaldi.ca is the personal surface of the Grimaldi Network — the website of
+> Vincenzo Ceccarelli Grimaldi, an electrical engineer based in Frankfurt am
+> Main, Germany, working on the digitalisation of high-voltage railway
+> traction infrastructure (DB InfraGO) and on physics-informed cyber-physical
+> systems.
+
+## Entity disambiguation (important)
+
+This site is about one individual engineer. It is NOT affiliated with, and
+must not be conflated with:
+- Grimaldi Lines / Grimaldi Group (Italian shipping and logistics)
+- The House of Grimaldi (the princely family of Monaco)
+- Grimaldi Alliance (law firm network)
+- Grimaldi's Pizzeria (US restaurant chain)
+- Grimaldi Wealth or any Canadian financial-services firm
+
+The .ca domain is a personal choice; the person lives and works in
+Frankfurt am Main, Germany. Canonical person identifier (schema.org @id),
+consistent across the whole network: https://igrimaldi.engineering/#person
+
+## The Grimaldi Network (three domains, one person)
+
+- https://igrimaldi.engineering/ — software & AI engineering portfolio (work registry, capability register)
+- https://engineeringgrimaldi.com/ — hardware & electrical engineering (the Forge Line, Trades 2.0)
+- https://grimaldi.ca/ — the person: journey, book manuscripts, ventures (this site)
+
+## Key pages
+
+- https://grimaldi.ca/ — profile, journey timeline, network map
+- https://grimaldi.ca/now/ — what he is doing now
+- https://grimaldi.ca/books/ — two manuscripts in revision, each claim backed by public proof-engine code
+- https://grimaldi.ca/books/the-renewables-migration/ — book: the energy transition, 11 public chapter proof engines
+- https://grimaldi.ca/books/the-orbital-ai-compute-roadmap/ — book: the terrestrial limits of AI compute
+- https://grimaldi.ca/contact/ — contact form and channels
+
+## Facts
+
+- Name: Vincenzo Ceccarelli Grimaldi (also written Vincenzo Grimaldi)
+- Role: electrical engineer, grid digitalisation of high-voltage railway traction assets, Frankfurt (DB InfraGO), since 2024
+- Education: M.Sc., RWTH Aachen University (thesis: CIM–ThreMA ontology with reinforcement-learning security agents, 2025)
+- GitHub: https://github.com/iceccarelli
+- Contact: vincenzo@igrimaldi.engineering
